Z||000018||Fiero5||09-10-2001||01:41 PM||||My first reaction is to go for the 85SE 5 speed!<BR>BUT, if you could snag the 88 for as low as you hope, that would make more sense in the long run in many areas. You could customize/add to it as you wanted/could afford and it would have your "name" all over it then.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pegasuswarriersSig.jpg">                            <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||7
