Z||000021||Leper||09-13-2001||02:56 AM||||With enough work you can attach any fascia to any year fiero. The 86 and newer GT fascias have the same style side molding as the 88 coupes, so you will want to get the fascia from one of those. Or change all your side molding to the kind with the center ridge in it.||||reg||1
